          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They move in small groups, walking around lazily. Anyone who makes eye contact gets smacked with a headbutt.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "数匹のグループで　行動する。 ちんたら　歩きまわり　目が　合った 相手に　いきなり　頭突きを　かます。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Pour se protéger, il remonte sa peau plissée jusqu’à son cou. Plus la peau est longue, plus Baggiguane inspirera de respect.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It stretches its saggy skin up to its neck to protect itself. The saggier their skin, the more respect they garner.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "だるんと　のびた　皮を　首まで 引っ張りあげて　ガード。　皮が のびている　個体ほど　偉いらしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "C’est un Pokémon dangereux qui distribue des coups de tête à quiconque ose croiser son regard.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "視線が　合ったら　危険！ 相手を　選ばず　頭突きで 襲ってくる　厄介者だ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se protège grâce à sa peau robuste. On dit que quand celle-ci ne peut plus s’étirer davantage, c’est qu’il est sur le point d’évoluer.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It protects itself with its durable skin. It’s thought that this Pokémon will evolve once its skin has completely stretched out.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "丈夫な　皮で　身を　守る。 皮が　伸びきるとき　進化を 迎えると　いわれる。",
